$$\nf({J}_{n}(\\lambda ))=[\\begin{aligned}f(\\lambda ) & {f}^{′}(\\lambda ) & \\frac{{f}^{″}(\\lambda )}{2!} & ⋯ & \\frac{{f}^{(n-1)}(\\lambda )}{(n-1)!} \\\\ 0 & f(\\lambda ) & {f}^{′}(\\lambda ) & ⋯ & \\frac{{f}^{(n-2)}(\\lambda )}{(n-2)!} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋱ & ⋱ & ⋱ & ⋮ \\\\ 0 & ⋯ & 0 & f(\\lambda ) & {f}^{′}(\\lambda ) \\\\ 0 & ⋯ & ⋯ & 0 & f(\\lambda )\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x,$ $n=3,$ and $\\lambda =2.$\n\nSince $n=3,$ we need to compute the first $3-1=2$ derivative of $f:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\ {f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{1}{x} \\\\ {f}^{″}(x) & =-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f({J}_{3}(2)) & =[\\begin{aligned}f(2) & {f}^{′}(2) & \\frac{1}{2!}{f}^{″}(2) \\\\ 0 & f(2) & {f}^{′}(2) \\\\ 0 & 0 & f(2)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2 & \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}(-\\frac{1}{4}) \\\\ 0 & \\operatorname{ln}⁡2 & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2 & \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{8} \\\\ 0 & \\operatorname{ln}⁡2 & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3e2ad92d-90c5-5fb3-835e-78716fc2952e" "answer-field-d8825eea-6236-5c45-a6bf-fa0d2e334802" "answer-field-67c84362-9ee8-5fb1-9cc5-4982acd43689" "answer-field-ca7af99b-f3db-551f-a410-e7335484fbb7" "answer-field-093ddcaf-e7d3-52fa-b839-ddb952fa312d" "answer-field-5cd3c5e6-c84b-55d0-9b74-8cf6164e62a1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3e2ad92d-90c5-5fb3-835e-78716fc2952e" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e2ad92d-90c5-5fb3-835e-78716fc2952e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-6955b1a9-a439-57c6-9b26-fa5bc116e904" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6955b1a9-a439-57c6-9b26-fa5bc116e904"] :db/ensure [:answer-fi